{
  "raw_html": "<button type='button' role='link' class='btn btn-link p-0 text-start' id='link_1' aria-label=\" L.K. Trust versus Commissioner of Income Tax & Anr. pdf\"  class='noToken' href='#' onclick=javascript:open_pdf('1','2026','2026_5_567_576','2026INSC474'); ><font size='4'> <strong>L.K. TRUST<span class='fst-italic'> versus </span>COMMISSIONER OF INCOME TAX & ANR. </strong>- <span class='escrText'>[2026] 5 S.C.R. 567</span><span class='ncDisplay'>2026 INSC 474</span><input type='hidden' id='cnr' value=ESCR010001582026></button></font><br><strong>Coram : J.B. PARDIWALA, UJJAL BHUYAN</strong><br> Issue for Consideration Issue arose whether the appellant-assessee is entitled to a deduction of Rs.21,74,234/- being the interest paid by it in respect of the loan availed from the Corporation Bank u/s.36(1)(iii) of the Income Tax Act 1961. Headnotes&dagger; Income Tax Act 1961 &ndash; interest paid in respect of capital borrowed for the purposes of business or profession &ndash; Assessee, if eligible for deduction of interest paid to the bank u/s.36(1)(iii) &ndash; Assessee borrowed loan from the Bank and paid interest in order to invest the same in its share business &ndash;<br><strong class='caseDetailsTD' ><span style='color:#212F3D' > Decision Date :</span><font color='green'> 07-05-2026</font><span style='color:#212F3D' > | Case No :</span><font color='green'> CIVIL APPEAL No. 527/2012</font><span style='color:#212F3D' > | Disposal Nature :</span><font color='green'> Appeal(s) allowed</font>   <span style='color:#212F3D' > |  Bench :</span><font color='green'> 2 Judges</font></strong><div class='row my-1 mt-2 border bg-light'><div class='col-auto'><a href='#' class='btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm my-1' onclick=open_splitview('1','2026','2026_5_567_576','2026INSC474','S')><i <i class='fas fa-columns me-2'></i>Split view</a></div><div class='col-auto'><a href='#' class='btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm my-1' onclick=open_splitview('1','2026','2026_5_567_576','2026INSC474','H'); ><i class='fas fa-file-alt me-2'></i>HTML view</a></div><div class='col-auto'><a href='#' class='btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm my-1' onclick=open_flip('1','2026','2026_5_567_576','2026INSC474');><i class='fas fa-book-open me-2' ></i>Flip view</a></div><div class='col-auto'><a href='#' class='btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm my-1' onclick=open_pdf('1','2026','2026_5_567_576','2026INSC474','N'); ><i class='fas fa-file-pdf me-2'></i>PDF</a></div></div>",
